## 🛠️ Technology Stack

| Component | Technology |
|-----------|-----------|
| Language | Python 3.10+ |
| CLI Framework | Typer |
| Terminal UI | Rich |
| AI Layer | LiteLLM (model-agnostic) |
| Validation | Pydantic |
| File Watching | Watchdog |
| Testing Core | pytest |
| UI Testing | Playwright (optional) |
| Reporting | Jinja2 |

